  {%- comment -%}
    Step 3 (conversion cleanup pass): Ready-Made Designs and Corporate/Bulk
    were removed as full homepage sections here. Corporate/Bulk was
    already reachable via nav, hero, and footer links, so that removal
    was safe on its own. Ready-Made Designs was NOT already linked
    anywhere else — this theme's nav is hardcoded, not a dynamic Shopify
    menu, and had no entry for it. Found during a bug check after the
    fact and fixed by adding a real nav link (see the header markup)
    rather than leaving the collection with no path to it at all.
  {%- endcomment -%}

