          <button type="button" class="btn btn-red" data-go="freeproof">Get My Free Proof</button>
          <blockquote class="tips-side-quote">
            <p>"Excellent customer service! The design team did an excellent job and we are so pleased to have a precious family picture transformed into such a cool art form."</p>
            <cite>— Aaron M., verified buyer</cite>
          </blockquote>
          <ul class="quicklist">
            <li><b>Best subjects</b> faces, pets, weddings, houses, logos</li>
            <li><b>Minimum quality</b> anything a phone shot in daylight</li>
            <li><b>Avoid</b> heavy filters, screenshots of screens, dark night shots</li>
            <li><b>More people</b> means a bigger board — see sizes above</li>
